{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsYmCEt59yC7NDgVhbLD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01M66pXzCQEwwen8w3X8Rr1a","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t02/primary/exec-ws/worksheet.md","content":"# e6-t02 computation worksheet (node: resolve-local)\n\nSource: `package/artifacts/orders.csv` — 18 data rows, each used exactly once.\nArithmetic: exact decimal (cents × integer qty), rounding to 2 places half away\nfrom zero. Every qty × unit_price product below is exact to the cent, so no\nper-order rounding was actually needed.\n\n## Per-order values (qty * unit_price)\n\n| order | region | product | qty | unit_price | value  |\n|-------|--------|---------|-----|------------|--------|\n| o001  | east   | bolt    | 8   | 42.25      | 338.00 |\n| o002  | west   | anvil   | 7   | 53.99      | 377.93 |\n| o003  | east   | anvil   | 5   | 17.50      | 87.50  |\n| o004  | north  | bolt    | 4   | 47.50      | 190.00 |\n| o005  | east   | crate   | 6   | 72.99      | 437.94 |\n| o006  | west   | bolt    | 7   | 26.99      | 188.93 |\n| o007  | west   | bolt    | 3   | 35.75      | 107.25 |\n| o008  | south  | duct    | 4   | 66.99      | 267.96 |\n| o009  | north  | anvil   | 4   | 70.75      | 283.00 |\n| o010  | east   | anvil   | 8   | 23.99      | 191.92 |\n| o011  | north  | crate   | 2   | 16.00      | 32.00  |\n| o012  | west   | duct    | 6   | 62.99      | 377.94 |\n| o013  | north  | bolt    | 1   | 17.50      | 17.50  |\n| o014  | north  | anvil   | 8   | 43.75      | 350.00 |\n| o015  | north  | crate   | 4   | 9.00       | 36.00  |\n| o016  | west   | bolt    | 6   | 25.25      | 151.50 |\n| o017  | east   | anvil   | 7   | 29.25      | 204.75 |\n| o018  | north  | bolt    | 6   | 48.50      | 291.00 |\n\n## Q1 — revenue by region and total (E-A)\n\n- east  = 338.00 + 87.50 + 437.94 + 191.92 + 204.75              = 1260.11\n- west  = 377.93 + 188.93 + 107.25 + 377.94 + 151.50             = 1203.55\n- north = 190.00 + 283.00 + 32.00 + 17.50 + 350.00 + 36.00 + 291.00 = 1199.50\n- south = 267.96                                                  = 267.96\n\nTotal = 1260.11 + 1203.55 + 1199.50 + 267.96 = **3931.12**\n\nCross-check: summing all 18 per-order values directly also gives 3931.12, so\nthe per-region figures are consistent with the overall total to the cent.\n\n## Q2 — median order value (E-B)\n\nSorted 18 per-order values:\n\n17.50, 32.00, 36.00, 87.50, 107.25, 151.50, 188.93, 190.00, 191.92,\n204.75, 267.96, 283.00, 291.00, 338.00, 350.00, 377.93, 377.94, 437.94\n\nEven count (18): median = mean of 9th and 10th values\n= (191.92 + 204.75) / 2 = 396.67 / 2 = 198.335\n→ rounded to 2 places, half away from zero = **198.34**\n\n## Q3 — top product by total qty (E-C)\n\n- anvil = 7 + 5 + 4 + 8 + 8 + 7 = **39**\n- bolt  = 8 + 4 + 7 + 3 + 1 + 6 + 6 = 35\n- crate = 6 + 2 + 4 = 12\n- duct  = 4 + 6 = 10\n\nMaximum is 39 (anvil), held uniquely — the lexicographic tie-break is not\ntriggered. Top product = **anvil**.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":597,"cache_read_input_tokens":33552,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":597},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79c59555-f870-426c-827a-c67f0a68ba2c","uuid":"ef2eaa66-1126-4086-ab6a-4b74ab6976ab","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:13:24.629Z","request_id":"req_011CdsYm9i5e1DUxRasb64K2"}
