{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsYryRs8mcjYyxtQphw6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stage S6 for e6-t02 is complete. The selected topology was the `local` family, so all four harness nodes were executed in-session and nothing is left pending integration.\n\n**Result** (`result.json`): total revenue **3931.12**, by region east 1260.11 / west 1203.55 / north 1199.50 / south 267.96; top product by qty **anvil** (39 units, unique maximum — tie-break not needed); median order value **198.34** (mean of the 9th and 10th sorted values, 191.92 and 204.75 → 198.335, rounded half away from zero).\n\nAll three distinctions (Q1 revenue aggregation, Q2 median, Q3 top product) are marked **RESOLVED** in `resolution.json` with `resolved_by: resolve-local` — each was locally resolvable from `orders.csv` alone, and the admissibility constraints were met: all 18 rows used exactly once, exact-decimal arithmetic (every qty × unit_price product lands exactly on a cent, so no rounding drift was possible), and region subtotals reconcile with the grand total to the cent.\n\nFiles written:\n- `worksheet.md` — full per-order value table, region sums, sorted median list, and per-product qty totals, so the arithmetic is re-checkable line by line\n- `resolution.json` — per the schema, all three Qs resolved\n- `result.json` — the deliverable in the exact shape from `package/task.json`\n- `evidence.json` — five records (ev-1…ev-5) attributed to their producing nodes\n- `execution-ledger.jsonl` — four events (observe / propose / verify / return), one per node in dependency order, with the verify event recording the non-authoritative self-check as PASS\n\nDeterministic root verification governs the final outcome, but every self-check passed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1017,"cache_read_input_tokens":41133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral